+    "description": (
+        "A JSON list [X,Y] of two nonzero signed decimal integers.  The instance "
+        "requires 1 <= |X| <= n and 1 <= |Y| <= Y_max.  A structure-aware random "
+        "candidate chooses one of the 4n sign-and-|X| choices and sets |Y| to "
