+    statement = f"""Find one finite integral point on the curve
+
+    Y^2 = X^6 + k
+
+where
+
+    k = {inst['k']}
+
+An integral point means an ordered pair (X,Y) of ordinary decimal integers
+satisfying the equation exactly.  Both signs are allowed and order matters.
